        },
        {
          "text": " Konyunyurikin Saul noi, kitakadik akirot nin; kinera ebe, “Ainakis Daudi ilukumin itomon, eoŋ da kainakis ilukumit bon; inyo bo do esalit dimarai ajakanut?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
