              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala Saul ebe, “Akorakini ŋes, tetere eraun eie kamaken, tetere da esurokini akan naka Ipilisitian ŋes.” Ŋes do atemaria Saul Daudi atiar, “Iraun lolo ekamuranika irwan nakiareit.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
