          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicorak Saul ikebulesin kere ebe, “Kinerata kaDaudi kaiyeiyea, ebe, ‘Koany, kisiyalamikinit ekabaka jo, kiminas da ikekejaanakinak kere: asa do koraun ekamuran loka ekabaka.’’’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kinerata ikejaanakinak luka Saul akiro nun kaki nuka Daudi, Kobala Daudi ebe, “Erai akirot naedit kamakus araun ekamuran loka ekabaka, naarai eeana eoŋ, mam arai loka aibuses naepol.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
