              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Saul atiar, “Itemarete Daudi kwanata ebe, Mam ekabaka ekoto akiitakinio idiobore, dimarai amunyin akwatat nuka ekiliokane loka Ipilisitian, ainyania lukasurupo luka ekabaka.” Koomite Saul Daudi aario kakan naka Ipilisman. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
