        },
        {
          "text": " Kosodete ikapolok luka Ipilisitian alomar aireb; kosodi kanen kwape alomanariata kesi aireb, kikemerenenei Daudi adepar ikejaanakinak luka Saul kere; kanuka nun koyoŋitete do noi ekekiror.",
